OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a chilly start, but
OL,6,Fstaying mainly dry and bright with
OL,7,Fsome sunny spells. However, there will
OL,8,Fbe isolated showers. Light north or
OL,9,Fnorthwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and often clear this
OL,12,Fevening and overnight, turning chilly
OL,13,Fwith a touch of frost in places. The
OL,14,Fodd mist and fog patch also possible.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FMainly dry and bright with
OL,17,Foccasional sunny breaks. Cloudier at
OL,18,Ftimes with isolated showers. Winds
OL,19,Fwill be light and variable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
